    <string name="source_tmdb_option">TMDB</string>
    <string name="source_open_body">Works immediately with no account or key. Movies and TV from the public Cinemeta catalogue, with TVmaze as the TV fallback; titles are matched by IMDb id (you can search tt0133093). Cinemeta is an unofficial source for third-party apps and may change or stop; switch to TMDB any time. IMDb ratings are not shown.</string>
